WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.340
- It's so funny because years
ago when you were on "Idol",

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.270
that was a big surprise
that my family presented

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.550
me and my brother with, that we would go

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.383
and see the show.
- I remember you telling

00:00:09.383 --> 00:00:10.216
me this, yes!

00:00:10.216 --> 00:00:11.491
- And I'll never forget, I
was sitting in the audience

00:00:11.491 --> 00:00:13.007
and my dad looked at me and was like,

00:00:13.007 --> 00:00:13.840
"It's gonna be you one day."

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.040
We were far up there, right?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.400
Lookin' down on the stage
and it still felt so massive

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.237
and my dad was like,

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:19.369
"That's gonna be you one day."

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:20.202
And I was like,

00:00:20.202 --> 00:00:21.096
"No, it's not." (laughs)
- That's so cool!

00:00:21.096 --> 00:00:22.581
Oh, yeah.
(audience laughs)

00:00:22.581 --> 00:00:24.090
That's great though.
- It seemed so far away,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.923
but, I don't know,

00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:26.325
to now be sitting here
with you on this show,

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:27.810
it's so special.
- Oh, what a great daddy!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.350
That's awesome!
(audience applause and cheers)

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.120
Speaking of your dad, (laughs)

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.580
when we worked together
before, I had no idea

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.320
your dad was a personal trainer
and then I saw a picture

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.530
and I was like, what?

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:37.363
- Yep, that's us, that's us.

00:00:37.363 --> 00:00:38.710
- [Kelly] Yeah, so do y'all
work out all the time?

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:39.543
- We do, yeah.

00:00:39.543 --> 00:00:40.821
- Look at that!

00:00:40.821 --> 00:00:42.696
(audience applause and cheers)

00:00:42.696 --> 00:00:44.370
I mean, that's crazy!

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:46.060
Is it cool to workout with
him or are you kinda like,

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.430
dad, lay off!

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:48.530
- That doesn't work anymore.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:49.363
- Oh. (laughs)

00:00:49.363 --> 00:00:50.250
- It used to for a while.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.207
That was like, you know,
that was the excuse.

00:00:52.207 --> 00:00:53.330
"Dad, this hurts."

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.690
And he's like, "Okay, we'll change it up."

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:55.540
And now it's like,

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.480
I go to him with certain
goals that I wanna achieve

00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.830
and he knows what he has
to do to get me there.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.680
So, no remorse.
- That's kind of awesome

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:02.513
though, you have a dad that...

00:01:02.513 --> 00:01:03.870
That's really, really cool.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:07.420
Okay, well whatever Haley
and her dad do, it's working.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.460
I need to show you this
pic we took a while back

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.293
at "The Voice"

00:01:10.293 --> 00:01:11.530
and I was like, what?
- Oh, no. (laughs)

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:13.200
- Like, her abs.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.326
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:17.940
'Cause I used to be fit, like
I used to like working out

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.707
and then I turned 30, but um.

00:01:19.707 --> 00:01:20.540
(audience laughs)
- Right. (laughs)

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.071
- And I was like, wait, I don't like this.

00:01:22.071 --> 00:01:22.904
(audience chuckles)

00:01:22.904 --> 00:01:24.470
But, does he have you doing, like...

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:27.100
'Cause I worked out a lot and
I never got abs like that.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.740
Like, are you doing just
like, 3000 crunches a day?

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:30.573
- Every day,

00:01:30.573 --> 00:01:31.846
3000 is the number.
- Oh!

00:01:31.846 --> 00:01:32.679
(audience laughs)

00:01:32.679 --> 00:01:34.020
You're joking.
- No.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.964
- Holy gah!

00:01:35.964 --> 00:01:36.990
Oh my gosh!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.010
You'd have to have like,
something like wine

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.030
sitting in front of you to keep...

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:40.863
I'd be like,

00:01:40.863 --> 00:01:42.140
I'm gonna get it!
- Everything under the sun

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:42.973
you could think of.

00:01:42.973 --> 00:01:43.806
Donuts, pizza,

00:01:43.806 --> 00:01:44.639
is all right in front of me.
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:44.639 --> 00:01:45.741
- Yep.

00:01:45.741 --> 00:01:47.653
- That was crazy, I was like, super hot!

